@host = http://localhost:5047
@tenant = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### List notification recipients
GET {{host}}/api/notifications/recipients
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}

### Create an Email recipient
POST {{host}}/api/notifications/recipients
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}

{
  "name": "Warehouse Supervisor",
  "channel": "Email",
  "destination": "warehouse@stocksync.demo"
}

### Create a WhatsApp recipient
POST {{host}}/api/notifications/recipients
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}

{
  "name": "Warehouse Supervisor WhatsApp",
  "channel": "WhatsApp",
  "destination": "+573001234567"
}

### List sent notifications
GET {{host}}/api/notifications?page=1&pageSize=20
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}

### Filter notifications by event type and channel
GET {{host}}/api/notifications?eventType=LowStock&channel=Email
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}
